    {
      "block_id": "page-0379-block-0005",
      "order": 5,
      "text": "SSRI + modafinil 200mg/day18,19\nBeneficial effect only \non hypersomnia. \nModafinil may induce \nsuicidal ideation\n",
      "bbox": [
        132.3900146484375,
        107.26790618896484,
        317.6469421386719,
        145.9779052734375
      ],
      "text_sha256": "26aec027698042759846b1f66f6413ba11b8a0741abf8d846014ba6ef2d12d55"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0379-block-0006",
      "order": 6,
      "text": "Possible effect on fatigue, but \nweak evidence base. An option \nwhere fatigue is prominent and \notherwise unresponsive.\n",
      "bbox": [
        321.7493896484375,
        107.2704086303711,
        424.4169616699219,
        145.97039794921875
      ],
      "text_sha256": "f84a0021f2a8926345c12eaae958d308ba4038ddf668823c1c85f66678f2f6b0"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0379-block-0007",
      "order": 7,
      "text": "SSRI + methylphenidate \n10–40mg/day20\nClear effect on fatigue \nin hospice patients\n",
      "bbox": [
        132.38938903808594,
        152.28541564941406,
        317.83447265625,
        171.00787353515625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "a78159f76db03b10a38f711d4cac9f55e2d7bb966b75c27db0465dc1ad770816"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0379-block-0008",
      "order": 8,
      "text": "Adjunctive \ntherapy in \ntreatment \nresistant \ndepression\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.889404296875,
        177.1428680419922,
        101.89439392089844,
        226.02035522460938
      ],
      "text_sha256": "1c3b6e8e45eca46edbb4f2aa1a2dd9f34fcd0829778afa45704787615151e488"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0379-block-0009",
      "order": 9,
      "text": "SSRI + modafinil 100–400mg a \nday7,21–26\n",
      "bbox": [
        132.389404296875,
        177.3153533935547,
        233.58688354492188,
        196.02035522460938
      ],
      "text_sha256": "e06b7e59368c96a845d07cc105eab0351d8f2d80526c4522e7110aa60b02fefc"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0379-block-0010",
      "order": 10,
      "text": "Effect mainly on \nfatigue and daytime \nsleepiness. \nMeta-analysis of 10 \ntrials suggested \nclinically significant \nimprovement in \ndepressive symptoms7\n",
      "bbox": [
        246.389404296875,
        177.32789611816406,
        315.47222900390625,
        256.01788330078125
      ],
      "text_sha256": "fc1b95b4b58684b00080fc63512390e37217a5167a2b2f4ea408c56ba3aed061"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0379-block-0011",
      "order": 11,
      "text": "Data limited. Modafinil may be \nuseful for fatigue27 and \ncognition.28\n",
      "bbox": [
        321.7496032714844,
        177.32789611816406,
        422.587158203125,
        206.03289794921875
      ],
      "text_sha256": "017d55c9b32e5672488b2ec856a8bbcb933c08e65b3f952e7e68f0805d0c6759"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0379-block-0012",
      "order": 12,
      "text": "MAOI + dexamfetamine \n7.5–40mg a day29 or \nlisdexamfetamine 50mg/day30\n",
      "bbox": [
        132.38929748535156,
        262.3529052734375,
        227.2506103515625,
        291.0578918457031
      ],
      "text_sha256": "a91126f561b8ffdb817114b6833e1a77ae132ed2b38bd4a5696516ae2fe60107"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0379-block-0013",
      "order": 13,
      "text": "Support from single \ncase series and one \ncase report\n",
      "bbox": [
        246.38929748535156,
        262.3529052734375,
        311.6843566894531,
        291.0553894042969
      ],
      "text_sha256": "781d3537843c93b2f469925dba0eaa59cc50ca7dc850b02a832a8d9a11d74362"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0379-block-0014",
      "order": 14,
      "text": "Stimulants an option in refractory \nillness but other options better \nsupported.\nOne naturalistic study suggests \nmethylphenidate may reduce \nself-harm or suicide attempts.31\n",
      "bbox": [
        321.7492980957031,
        262.34539794921875,
        430.78436279296875,
        321.0403747558594
      ],
      "text_sha256": "8f1d4f9697afb588e692b229e6d095b01dded8d0e44f101dfc1bb332c81480e6"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0379-block-0015",
      "order": 15,
      "text": "Methylphenidate or \ndexamfetamine ± \nantidepressant32\n",
      "bbox": [
        132.38929748535156,
        297.3778991699219,
        197.39927673339844,
        326.08038330078125
      ],
      "text_sha256": "ba191059531009b8d6e34120c09da6e78250e909b2ab2a5408d02a4d41c4f0a2"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0379-block-0016",
      "order": 16,
      "text": "Large case series \n(n = 50) suggests \nbenefit in the \nmajority\n",
      "bbox": [
        246.38929748535156,
        297.3778991699219,
        303.41937255859375,
        336.077880859375
      ],
      "text_sha256": "e971cd94fd673e67fce5f50bbeeffe546f8bef8d5727fd61b4776fc5e7ea3da4"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0379-block-0017",
      "order": 17,
      "text": "Lisdexamfetamine 20–70mg/\nday + antidepressant7,17,33\n",
      "bbox": [
        132.38929748535156,
        342.39288330078125,
        224.89427185058594,
        361.0978698730469
      ],
      "text_sha256": "21751f6d0a31a7d3ff35ec0ed99bea088f86f685f7256dfd97b88b97ef16df6d"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0379-block-0018",
      "order": 18,
      "text": "Two meta-analyses \nfound a small, \nnon-significant effect \non depressive \nsymptoms compared \nto placebo\n",
      "bbox": [
        246.38929748535156,
        342.40289306640625,
        312.94427490234375,
        401.0978698730469
      ],
      "text_sha256": "580c8404867bfd79649b736a354b1d0529f01ca15df7b55242df318dcc5592ba"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0379-block-0019",
      "order": 19,
      "text": "Adjunctive \ntreatment in \nbipolar \ndepression34,35\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.88929748535156,
        407.23284912109375,
        111.0269775390625,
        446.11285400390625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "fe6f653753b011b5adcee002a9eabd1bfbb78476aca02cb174b3c3ca3c2b414f"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0379-block-0020",
      "order": 20,
      "text": "Mood stabiliser and/or \nantidepressants + modafinil \n100–200mg/day36\n",
      "bbox": [
        132.38929748535156,
        407.42791748046875,
        221.4292755126953,
        436.1304016113281
      ],
      "text_sha256": "11acf7930381763875c068422cbcd1a4b740a8ca7e72ed2af05ab1134548e8db"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0379-block-0021",
      "order": 21,
      "text": "Significantly superior \nto placebo\n",
      "bbox": [
        246.38929748535156,
        407.42791748046875,
        314.7218322753906,
        426.1329040527344
      ],
      "text_sha256": "2e98c313ed239c76a9e23adc837aac6af3402f44fbb3fbc32ffb097bcbdfe9a2"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0379-block-0022",
      "order": 22,
      "text": "Possible treatment option where \nother standard treatments fail. \nMeta-analysis of trials referenced \nhere found stimulants well \ntolerated and an overall benefit \nversus placebo.37\n",
      "bbox": [
        321.7492980957031,
        407.42791748046875,
        428.9693298339844,
        466.1228942871094
      ],
      "text_sha256": "33eadb65b28fb2acd7d9b8d207b494a68542ae64726c7227de617695c5049458"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0379-block-0023",
      "order": 23,
      "text": "No evidence of treatment-\nemergent mania.34,37,38\n",
      "bbox": [
        321.7496032714844,
